    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Brain and Mind Institute (BMI) at the Aga Khan University made a courtesy visit to the County Government of Kilifi to deliberate on how best the Institute can collaborate and partner with the County Government of Kilifi in ensuring the promotion and enhancement of mental and brain health within the county, during a two-day visit from 20 - 21 November 2023.",
